# A copy effect applies in layer 1 and the other continuous effects after it (CR 613.1a, 613.4c, 707.2), so a static
# effect already out applies to the Clone's copied values as it would to any creature. On turn 1 Bot1 casts Warleader's
# Call ("Creatures you control get +1/+1"), then Ornithopter, then Clone copying the Ornithopter: both are 1/3, the
# printed 0/2 with the anthem on top. Each entering creature is a creature Bot1 controls entering, so the Call's trigger
# deals 1 damage to Bot2 twice, the Clone included.

